msgid "Reactive Messaging RabbitMQ Connector reference documentation"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This guide is the companion to the xref:rabbitmq.adoc[Getting Started with "
"RabbitMQ].\n"
"It explains in more details the configuration and usage of the RabbitMQ "
"connector for reactive messaging."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The RabbitMQ connector allows Quarkus applications to send and receive "
"messages using the AMQP 0.9.1 protocol.\n"
"More details about the protocol can be found in https://www.rabbitmq.com/"
"amqp-0-9-1-reference.html#queue.bind.routing-key[the AMQP 0.9.1 "
"specification]."
msgstr ""

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In _preview_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem is not "
"guaranteed.\n"
"Specific improvements might require changing configuration or APIs, and "
"plans to become _stable_ are under way.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-"
"dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-"
"are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr ""

