msgid "Configuring the RabbitMQ Broker access"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The RabbitMQ connector connects to RabbitMQ brokers.\n"
"To configure the location and credentials of the broker, add the following "
"properties in the `application.properties`:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Configures the broker host name. You can do it per channel (using the `host` "
"attribute) or globally using `rabbitmq-host`"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Configures the broker port. You can do it per channel (using the `port` "
"attribute) or globally using `rabbitmq-port`. The default is `5672`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Configures the broker username if required. You can do it per channel (using "
"the `username` attribute) or globally using `rabbitmq-username`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Configures the broker password if required. You can do it per channel (using "
"the `password` attribute) or globally using `rabbitmq-password`."
